{"id":786606,"title":"32｜AutoGen添加自定义技能","content":"本节课介绍了如何使用AutoGen Studio配置多种技能以实现复杂应用场景。具体场景为：通过软件读取Word文档内容，将其转换成语音格式，并对内容进行概要性总结，最后将总结发送至邮箱。整个过程涉及四个主要技能：阅读Word文档、生成文档摘要、文本转语音及邮件发送。演示了从用户代理接收到需求开始，到最终结果呈现的全过程。首先，用户代理将需求传递给primary assistant，后者调用相关技能完成任务。其中，读取本地Word文件的任务可通过向大模型请求代码实现，无需手动编码。代码要求包括接收动态路径参数和添加英文注释以便于agent理解。获取代码后，在PyCharm中测试其功能，确保无误后再集成到skill中。创建并命名新skill（如read word content），将其添加至primary assistant，并在workflow中激活该技能。通过playground中的session验证新添加的技能是否能正确读取指定Word文档内容。此课程旨在帮助学习者掌握利用AutoGen Studio构建自动化工作流的方法。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398238,"user_name":"Geek_3813e3","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2859889,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"288DFD22E5AD7C","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/llaLwsfmdhRlAU2cfbHuicuwian4CWOJF0PaXYxWucNzZQGTF6JCERv1Dk0L1dsGdOjZ6WVcYZ1cZMUad1VpwwKw/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1740911466,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"autogenstudio是哪个版本的啊","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":396288,"user_name":"Mong狗","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1048525,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"9DF0D65D75984E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/ff/cd/9c44f2d5.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1733883682,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"强啊，小姑娘","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":392681,"user_name":"Eric","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1205698,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"06BE5025CA56D2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/65/c2/5f00485d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721533979,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"添加读取word文档的技能，对应的代码让智普清言大模型生成，人工确认代码可执行即可","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":392611,"user_name":"Geek_4d7e61","can_delete